nubo-os (0.7.0) resolute; urgency=medium

  * App set: Calendar, Contacts, Weather, Maps, Videos, Scanner, Archive
    Manager, Podcasts, Books, Voice Memos, Backup, Reminders; Folio, LocalSend
    and Newelle from Flathub on first boot. Entries renamed Nubo-style.
  * Nubo Setup: first-run sign-in and account creation (device flow).
  * First-boot and account services now skip the installation media by
    testing for the /cdrom mount (the earlier test never matched).
  * Identity sweep: Inter and JetBrains Mono fonts, boot menu says Nubo OS,
    session entry, text boot screen, legal text, console messages, About
    version string, Settings panel icon.
  * nubo-desktop now replaces ubuntu-desktop-minimal and conflicts with
    Ubuntu's Pro, reporting, crash and update tools and the Yaru theme.
  * Firefox from Mozilla's package repository instead of the snap; Ubuntu's
    store and helper snaps removed on first boot; Flathub added.
  * Nubo Store: GNOME Software renamed, with Flatpak support.
  * Dock defaults: Firefox, Files, Nubo Store, Settings, Terminal.
  * Uniform corner radii for dock, menus, notifications and dialogs.
  * Ubuntu's first-run wizard removed: every page left in it was Ubuntu's.
    A Nubo first run (account sign-in) replaces it later.

